 boolean awaitingCapture=false; int dp(int n){return (int)(n*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density+.5f);} android.graphics.drawable.GradientDrawable rounded(int c,int radius){android.graphics.drawable.GradientDrawable d=new android.graphics.drawable.GradientDrawable();d.setColor(c);d.setCornerRadius(dp(radius));return d;} void style(Button b,int c){b.setTextColor(Color.WHITE);b.setTextSize(12);b.setAllCaps(false);b.setMinWidth(0);b.setMinimumWidth(0);b.setPadding(dp(12),0,dp(12),0);b.setBackground(rounded(c,20));} void captureReady(){if(!awaitingCapture){if(RecordingService.instance!=null)RecordingService.instance.finishCapture();return;}waitForRicardo(SystemClock.elapsedRealtime()+5000);} void waitForRicardo(long limit){if(!awaitingCapture)return;if(target()){awaitingCapture=false;beginSession();}else if(SystemClock.elapsedRealtime()>=limit){finish();}else h.postDelayed(()->waitForRicardo(limit),200);} void beginSession(){long now=SystemClock.elapsedRealtime();running=true;paused=false;generation++;remaining=new int[]{30,60,90,120,180}[cfg("duration",3)]*1000L;ready=now+new int[]{3,5,10}[cfg("count",1)]*1000L;deadline=ready+remaining;main.setText("Pause");h.post(tick);} void finish(){awaitingCapture=false;if(RecordingService.instance!=null&&!RecordingService.instance.closing)RecordingService.instance.finishCapture();once=false;generation++;running=false;paused=false;h.removeCallbacks(tick);if(main!=null)main.setText("Start");syncPanel();}
 @Override protected void onServiceConnected(){instance=this;connected=true;foreground=false;detected=false;log("Service connected");wm=getSystemService(WindowManager.class);panel=new LinearLayout(this);panel.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER_VERTICAL);panel.setPadding(dp(5),dp(4),dp(5),dp(4));panel.setBackground(rounded(0xff202936,24));main=new Button(this);main.setText("Start");stop=new Button(this);stop.setText("Stop");panel.addView(main);panel.addView(stop);single=new Button(this);single.setText("1 Swipe");panel.addView(single);style(main,0xff2563eb);style(stop,0xffb91c1c);style(single,0xff475569);TextView grip=new TextView(this);grip.setText("⋮⋮");grip.setTextColor(Color.WHITE);grip.setTextSize(20);grip.setPadding(dp(8),0,dp(8),0);panel.addView(grip,0);single.setOnClickListener(v->{if(!target()||running||busy)return;once=true;running=true;paused=false;generation++;ready=SystemClock.elapsedRealtime();deadline=ready+5000;h.post(tick);});WindowManager.LayoutParams lp=new WindowManager.LayoutParams(-2,-2,WindowManager.LayoutParams.TYPE_ACCESSIBILITY_OVERLAY,WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_NOT_FOCUSABLE,PixelFormat.TRANSLUCENT);lp.gravity=Gravity.TOP|Gravity.START;lp.y=100;lp.x=0;grip.setOnTouchListener(new View.OnTouchListener(){float x,y;int sx,sy;public boolean onTouch(View v,android.view.MotionEvent e){if(e.getAction()==MotionEvent.ACTION_DOWN){x=e.getRawX();y=e.getRawY();sx=lp.x;sy=lp.y;return true;}if(e.getAction()==MotionEvent.ACTION_MOVE){android.util.DisplayMetrics dm=new android.util.DisplayMetrics();wm.getDefaultDisplay().getMetrics(dm);lp.x=Math.max(0,Math.min(dm.widthPixels-panel.getWidth(),sx+(int)(e.getRawX()-x)));lp.y=Math.max(0,Math.min(dm.heightPixels-panel.getHeight(),sy+(int)(e.getRawY()-y)));wm.updateViewLayout(panel,lp);return true;}if(e.getAction()==MotionEvent.ACTION_UP){v.performClick();return true;}return true;}});try{wm.addView(panel,lp);overlayState="created";}catch(RuntimeException ex){overlayState=ex.getClass().getSimpleName();panel=null;return;}panel.setVisibility(View.GONE);main.setOnClickListener(v->{if(!target())return;long now=SystemClock.elapsedRealtime();if(!running){if(awaitingCapture)return;if(cfg("record",1)==1){awaitingCapture=true;android.content.Intent i=new android.content.Intent(this,MainActivity.class).putExtra("capture",true).addFlags(android.content.Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK);startActivity(i);}else beginSession();}else if(!paused){remaining=Math.max(0,deadline-Math.max(now,ready));paused=true;generation++;h.removeCallbacks(tick);main.setText("Resume");}else{paused=false;generation++;ready=now+1000;deadline=ready+remaining;main.setText("Pause");h.post(tick);}});stop.setOnClickListener(v->finish());}
 @Override public void onAccessibilityEvent(AccessibilityEvent e){int kind=e.getEventType(); CharSequence pkg=e.getPackageName(); if(kind!=AccessibilityEvent.TYPE_WINDOW_STATE_CHANGED){if(!foreground && pkg!=null && TARGET.contentEquals(pkg) && e.getEventTime()>=lastWindowEvent && SystemClock.uptimeMillis()-e.getEventTime()<500 && getSystemService(android.os.PowerManager.class).isInteractive() && !getSystemService(android.app.KeyguardManager.class).isKeyguardLocked()){foreground=true;detected=true;lastPackage=TARGET;lastRicardo=TARGET;log("Ricardo recovered from fresh interaction");syncPanel();}return;} lastWindowEvent=e.getEventTime(); lastPackage=pkg==null?"unknown":pkg.toString(); log(lastPackage); if(lastPackage.equals(getPackageName()) && e.getClassName()!=null && e.getClassName().toString().equals("android.widget.LinearLayout")){log("Own overlay event ignored");return;} if(lastPackage.equals("com.android.systemui")){boolean wasTarget=foreground;foreground=false;detected=false;if(!awaitingCapture)finish();log("System window: gestures stopped");if(panel!=null&&!testing){panel.setVisibility(wasTarget?View.VISIBLE:View.GONE);main.setEnabled(false);single.setEnabled(false);overlayState=wasTarget?"visible, suspended":"hidden";}return;} foreground=pkg!=null && TARGET.contentEquals(pkg);detected=foreground;if(foreground)lastRicardo=lastPackage;if(!target()&&running)finish();syncPanel();}
 void syncPanel(){if(panel==null||testing)return;boolean ok=target();main.setEnabled(ok);single.setEnabled(ok&&!running);panel.setVisibility(ok&&!busy?View.VISIBLE:View.GONE);overlayState=ok?(busy?"gesture hidden":"visible"):"hidden";}
 void step(){if(!running||paused)return;if(!target()){finish();return;}long now=SystemClock.elapsedRealtime();if(now>=deadline){finish();return;}if(now<ready){main.setText("Pause "+((ready-now+999)/1000));h.postDelayed(tick,200);return;}main.setText("Pause "+((deadline-now+999)/1000));if(busy){h.postDelayed(tick,100);return;}Rect r=new Rect(); if(Build.VERSION.SDK_INT>=30){WindowMetrics m=wm.getCurrentWindowMetrics();r.set(m.getBounds());android.graphics.Insets i=m.getWindowInsets().getInsetsIgnoringVisibility(WindowInsets.Type.systemBars()|WindowInsets.Type.displayCutout());r.left+=i.left;r.top+=i.top;r.right-=i.right;r.bottom-=i.bottom;}else{android.util.DisplayMetrics m=new android.util.DisplayMetrics();wm.getDefaultDisplay().getMetrics(m);r.set(0,0,m.widthPixels,m.heightPixels);}if(r.width()<100||r.height()<300){finish();return;}float top=r.top+r.height()*20/100f,bottom=r.top+r.height()*76/100f;float overlap=new int[]{15,20,25}[cfg("overlap",1)]/100f;float end=bottom-(bottom-top)*(1-overlap);int ms=350;if(deadline-now<ms){h.postDelayed(tick,deadline-now);return;}int token=generation;busy=true;gestureState="dispatching";float x=r.left+r.width()*25/100f;log("Swipe x="+x+" y="+bottom+" to "+end+" ms="+ms);panel.setVisibility(View.INVISIBLE);boolean sent=sendSwipe(x,bottom,end,ms,new GestureResultCallback(){public void onCompleted(GestureDescription g){gestureState="completed";log("Swipe completed");busy=false;syncPanel();if(once){finish();return;}if(token==generation&&running&&!paused)h.postDelayed(tick,cfg("mode",0)==0?new int[]{1500,2500,4000,6000}[cfg("pause",1)]:350);}public void onCancelled(GestureDescription g){gestureState="cancelled";log("Swipe cancelled");busy=false;if(panel!=null&&target())panel.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);if(token==generation)finish();}});if(!sent){gestureState="rejected";log("Swipe rejected");busy=false;if(panel!=null&&target())panel.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);finish();}}
 @Override public void onInterrupt(){finish();} @Override public void onDestroy(){instance=null;connected=false;detected=false;finish();if(panel!=null)wm.removeView(panel);super.onDestroy();}
